OL,3,GNEWSAMinisters rejected plans for stamp
OL,4,Aduty holiday
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey ministers considered reducing
OL,7,Fstamp duty for homeowners hoping to
OL,8,F"right size" but ultimately decided
OL,9,Fagainst it as there was "insufficient
OL,10,Fevidence" it would free up properties
OL,11,Ffor families.
OL,13,FMinister for Treasury and Resources
OL,14,FAlan Maclean revealed he and Minister
OL,15,Ffor Housing Malcolm Fery looked at
OL,16,Fincluding a stamp duty holiday in the
OL,17,Fproposed 2027-2030 budget.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
