OL,3,GNEWSAMinisters rejected plans for stamp
OL,4,Aduty holiday
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Senator Maclean said there was
OL,7,Fa "joint decision" not to proceed after
OL,8,Fa review of advice from officers, an
OL,9,Fanalysis of housing market conditions
OL,10,Fand the potential cost to the public
OL,11,Fpurse.
OL,13,F"Right-sizing" involves encouraging
OL,14,Funder-occupying tenants move into
OL,15,Fsmaller homes to help increase supply.
